Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 03:55:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(home): wrap session reads in Suspense; add starter pack
 welcome + hold-to-open reveal

- /home: move request-time data into a Suspense boundary (fixes Date.now() prerender error with cacheComponents)
- first visit shows welcome banner and starter pack; press and hold to open (shaking pack + progress slider), then reveal fighters and return home
- add missing deps to package.json (@supabase/ssr, supabase-js, react-query, socket.io-client, clsx)
